## 4. A fixed sleep against an auto-waiting assertion, fast API (100 ms)
   concept: the total is filled by a fetch after the page loads. waitForTimeout(500) then reading textContent passes while the API answers in 100 ms; toHaveText retries until the text matches or 5 s pass
