## 5. The same two tests, slow API (1500 ms): the flake made deterministic
   concept: a slow CI runner or a loaded database is all it takes: the fixed sleep reads 'Loading total...' and fails, the web-first assertion waits and passes. trace: retain-on-failure keeps a trace (DOM snapshots, network, console, each action) only for the failure
